Q8. How many objects are eligible for garbage collection after the last line?

class A { }

// inside main
A a1 = new A();
A a2 = new A();

a1 = a2;
a2 = null;

// here

A. 0
B. 1
C. 2
D. Cannot be determined

ANSWER: B. 1

Explanation: The first A object has no reference after a1 = a2, so only that object becomes eligible for GC.


